  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CTAE Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will address the three major issues listed above by upgrading their workshops, supplying needed training to enhance their management, financial, and production capacity, and by providing the necessary equipment and working capital. CTAE is currently unable to meet the demands of their clients who are intermediaries between CTAE and their final clients, rural household consumers and cattle breeders. This project will also contribute to food security in the region.</narrative>
  </description>
